    "%%cython\n",
    "# Full MODIFIED and FIXED Cython cell: MOACP hybrid where LLM generates neighbor additions\n",
    "# - FIX: Corrected the acceptance logic in compute_fitness_and_select.\n",
    "# - LLM suggests items to ADD; one item is removed RANDOMLY (like baseline).\n",
    "# - Changes are applied on a temporary copy; original 'x' is not modified unless we commit.\n",
    "# - Candidate items are filtered so each individually fits remaining capacity for all objectives.\n",
    "# - Parser accepts \"ADD: none\", \"ADD: 12, 34\", \"ADD: Item 12, Item 34\" etc.\n",
    "# - Pre-validation verifies sums across objectives before committing changes.\n",
    "# Use as a notebook %%cython cell or compile as .pyx.\n",
    "\n",
